{"kind":"artifact","text":"Candidate: the ambient adjunct at cmd/gitseq-mcp on the same head. Every completed tool call carries live_attention, attached where both success and error results are built, so a failing call still tells the caller who addressed them. Event identifiers are extracted by exact canonical pattern from the call input and its result, capped at 32. live_attention is a sibling of structuredContent rather than a wrapper: an earlier draft nested the payload and would have broken the consumer documented in notes/2026-08-07-bootstrap-task-cycle.md, which the existing tests did not catch because none pinned the envelope shape. The read never returns an error, and a guaranteed text block states pending chat and relevant actors so a client that ignores structured content still sees the interruption.","body":{"commit":"35bcd321629d531909ee8aff33dbfa3214008cda","path":"cmd/gitseq-mcp"}}